     "title": "Change in Biomarkers of Inflammation",
     "description": "Change in IL-6, IL-10 and TNF-alpha levels (pg/ml) at day 3 in participants with acute alcohol associated hepatitis treated with digoxin vs no digoxin.",
     "populationDescription": "Intention-to-treat",
     "reportingStatus": "POSTED",
